 the batter to get a lovely brown crust on the bottom and sides of the bread.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#1c1c1c;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Think about how we all feel about those chewy crispy edges on brownies. Yes, you know&nbsp;what I mean. They even made a special pan for making those individual little brownies so that all the sides are crispy.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">You can also buy cast iron pans for making cornbread in&nbsp;individual&nbsp;servings that are fantastic for this too but if you don&#39;t have one or don&#39;t want to devote the storage to keeping one, a large skillet is just the thing.&nbsp;</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-k1pdxayv":{"crop":{"x":0,"y":69,"width":4032,"height":2886},"alt":"Sweet and Crispy Jalapeno Cornbread Skillet","width":4032,"height":3024,"uri":"577c92_e2976ef728d34938a7eb25d7cecfa89c~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg","name":"20191006_185420.jpg","containerId":"comp-k1pdxayv","hasBgScrollEf